{"schemaVersion": 1, "id": "23c8510f-1a68-4b5e-b8d1-b173b9f4a2b1", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T20:41:34Z", "runtime": "executorch-mlx", "engineVersion": "v1.5.1", "engineArtifact": "llama_main sha256:4c2eac5a46ee6d81e943d79add7c40f00050609688e8ee0a415b7f69f923179d", "model": {"id": "own-export/Qwen3-1.7B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048", "quantization": "4w: int4 symmetric weight-only, group 128, HQQ scale-only (every Linear incl. lm_head), fp32 activations; embedding int8 per-row (embedding_byte, outside the delegate); fp32 compute and KV cache; MLX delegate; own export, ExecuTorch 1.5.1", "sha256": "2b065106b8724cedccc596968ddd6ab01105220d8b5cdcd9d8de89f0db466931", "file": "Qwen3-1.7B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048.pte", "hfRevision": "70d244cc86ccca08cf5af4e1e306ecf908b1ad5e"}, "task": "long-context-1024-gen256", "device": {"systemName": "macOS", "modelIdentifier": "Mac16,9", "chip": "Apple M4 Max", "systemVersion": "Version 27.0 (Build 26A428)", "processorCount": 16, "physicalMemoryMB": 131072, "batteryState": "unknown", "buildConfiguration": "Release"}, "conditions": {"executorchRunner": "llama_main", "sampler": "greedy (--temperature 0: argmax)", "maxOutputTokens": 256, "chatMode": "host chat template: HF apply_chat_template(add_generation_prompt=True), template defaults (transformers 5.0.0rc1, Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B@70d244cc86cc); llama_main --prompt_file, num_bos 0", "thinkingPolicy": "model default: the chat template rendered without enable_thinking (Qwen 3: thinking on); reasoning tokens count against the same budget", "cpuThreadsPolicy": "engine heuristic (--cpu_threads -1: cpuinfo get_num_performant_cores)", "contextSource": "runner log (Metadata: get_max_context_len)", "contextBudget": 2048, "contextTokens": 2048, "cpuThreads": 16, "warm": false, "regime": "cold", "thermalInitial": "nominal", "thermalFinal": "nominal", "loadAverage": 3.40771484375, "loadAverages": [3.40771484375, 4.74072265625, 4.38818359375], "busyOthers": ["mds_stores:62%"], "cpuSpeedLimit": null, "exitCode": 0, "launchWallSeconds": 1.851, "runIndex": 1, "textCheck": {"status": "PASS", "alphanumericCount": 957, "distinctWords": 97, "taskTerms": true, "flags": [], "method": "the runner's generated text (parsers: textExtraction) + lexical screen; full text retained"}, "textOutputSHA256": "9b89cacfe2bdeba5d97ca5d4307dd44081920668c6fd39a289e7f10e4f8ee8d0"}, "metrics": {"promptTokenCount": 1338, "generatedTokenCount": 255, "promptTokensPerSecond": 3475.3246753246754, "decodeTokensPerSecond": 209.18785890073832, "firstTokenLatencyMS": 385, "loadTimeSeconds": 0.066, "coldRun": true, "harnessStamp": "executorch-mac-v1-2026-10-08", "initialThermalState": "nominal", "finalThermalState": "nominal", "memoryPeakResidentMB": 1299.8125}, "harnessStamp": "executorch-mac-v1-2026-10-08", "decodedText": "<think>\nOkay, let's tackle this query. The user wants a list of 25 distinct things that on-device AI allows a phone to do that a cloud model can't. And each item needs two full sentences explaining it.\n\nFirst, I need to recall what on-device AI means. It's processing done on the device's hardware, not relying on the cloud. So, things like local computation, data privacy, real-time processing, etc. \n\nLet me start by brainstorming possible points. Maybe things like local computation, data privacy, real-time processing, low-latency, offline capabilities, reduced data transfer, energy efficiency, local decision-making, reduced latency, no internet required, etc. \n\nI need to make sure each item is distinct and not overlapping. Also, the user said \"distinct things,\" so each should be a unique capability. \n\nLet me think of 25 points. Maybe start with the basics: local computation, data privacy, real-time processing, etc. Then think of other aspects like energy efficiency, reduced data transfer, etc. \n\nI need to make sure each item is a unique thing. For example, one could be local computation, another is data privacy, another is real-time processing. Then maybe energy efficiency, reduced data transfer", "outputSample": "<think>\nOkay, let's tackle this query. The user wants a list of 25 distinct things that on-device AI allows a phone to do that a cloud model can't. And each item needs two full sentences explaining it", "provenance": {"definitions": "prefill tok/s = prompt_tokens / (prompt_eval_end_ms - inference_start_ms) * 1000. The window opens before the runner tokenizes the prompt (TextLLMRunner::generate sets inference_start_ms, then encodes), so prefill includes tokenization.\nTTFT ms = first_token_ms - inference_start_ms = the same window (first_token_ms is taken when prefill returns, before the first token is decoded to text).\ndecode tok/s = generated_tokens / (inference_end_ms - prompt_eval_end_ms) * 1000, generated_tokens = tokens of the decode loop; the reply has one more token, the one prefill sampled.\ncold = one generation in a fresh llama_main process (no --warmup). warm = llama_main --warmup: one unmeasured generation of the same prompt and max_new_tokens in the same process, stats and KV position reset, the second generation measured.\nClock: integer milliseconds (extension/llm/runner/util.h time_in_ms).", "recipe": "Qwen3-1.7B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048.recipe.json", "recipeSha256": "24b88235d668f59ecb93ff4c8d2559fc38e02de6c91b9335acb117c11c37ed89", "recipeAlias": "et1.5.1-mlx-4w-g128-emb8", "exporter": "extension/llm/export/export_llm (examples/models/qwen3/config/qwen3_xnnpack_q8da4w.yaml)", "modelProvenance": "own export with the ExecuTorch tag's own exporter (recipe.json beside the .pte); not a published artifact", "promptFile": "Qwen3-1.7B-ET1.5.1-mlx-4w-emb8-ctx2048.prompts/long-context-1024-gen256.chat.txt", "promptSha256": "360771899cd15f27bcedd5911f5c7f6775ccc15a092e2d133ec29cd83c90baf2", "tokenizer": "tokenizer.json", "tokenizerSha256": "aeb13307a71acd8fe81861d94ad54ab689df773318809eed3cbe794b4492dae4", "textExtraction": "stdout minus the echoed prompt, cut before '\\nPyTorchObserver '", "statsLine": "PyT